#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:9
msgid "STM32F4 外部存储器"
msgstr "STM32F4 external memory"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:11
msgid ""
"本页分别说明 F407 FSMC 和 F479 FMC／QuadSPI，三种控制器不因名称相近共享硬件 权限。F407 FSMC 实现限定 "
"STM32F407VET6（LQFP100）与 STM32F407ZGT6（LQFP144）； F479 软件参考的 SDRAM "
"数据窗口、显式图形存储模式与间接串行 NOR 见后续章节。 一个 `nx_stm32_fsmc_t` 管理唯一 FSMC gate、共享 AF12 "
"pads 和所选 bank receipt。 SRAM、LCD、PSRAM、NOR、NAND 端点借用这个 owner；端点不会另建 RCC、GPIO "
"或 控制器注册表。原有 NE3 启动 SRAM 仍由复位计划的同一 const bank 描述符证明， 永久 boot owner 不允许 "
"stop，也不向运行时发放覆盖 globals 的整 bank lease。"
msgstr ""
"This page separately describes F407 FSMC and F479 FMC/QuadSPI; similar names"
" do not share hardware authority. F407 FSMC targets STM32F407VET6(LQFP100) "
"and STM32F407ZGT6(LQFP144). The F479 software references for SDRAM data "
"windows, explicit graphics-owned storage and indirect serial NOR are "
"described below. One `nx_stm32_fsmc_t` owns the sole FSMC gate, shared AF12 "
"pads and selected bank receipts. SRAM, LCD, PSRAM, NOR and NAND endpoints "
"borrow that owner; endpoints create no separate RCC, GPIO or controller "
"registry. The existing NE3 startup SRAM is still proved by the same const "
"bank descriptor in the reset plan. Its permanent boot owner cannot stop or "
"grant a runtime whole-bank lease overlapping globals."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:19
msgid ""
"硬件依据是 RM0090 Rev22 第 36 章及 DS8626 Rev12 的 AF12 映射和 FSMC 时序限制。 官方 "
"`stm32f4xx_ll_fsmc.c` 负责 NORSRAM/NAND 初始化、读写时序和 ECC enable/disable。 F407 没有 "
"FMC 的连续 clock、write FIFO disable 等新增控制位。同步外部 CLK 不得超过 60 MHz；CRAM 页边界用 "
"CPSIZE 明确选择 128/256/512/1024 字节或关闭。"
msgstr ""
"Hardware references are RM0090 Rev22 chapter36 and the AF12 mapping/FSMC "
"timing limits in DS8626 Rev12. Official `stm32f4xx_ll_fsmc.c` implements "
"NORSRAM/NAND initialization, read/write timings and ECC enable/disable. F407"
" lacks later FMC controls such as continuous clock and write-FIFO disable. "
"External synchronous CLK must not exceed 60 MHz. CPSIZE explicitly selects a"
" CRAM page boundary of 128/256/512/1024 bytes or disables it."

