#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:34
msgid ""
"`fsmc-reference-*` 路线描述芯片 pad inventory，端点参数选择实际需要的精确子集。 Board "
"必须显式授权该路线；配置不会替换一块未知 PCB，也不会自动探测安装器件。 VE 缺少 PF/PG，独立地址的旧 ZG SRAM 路线不能沿用；VE "
"可显式使用 NE1 的复用 地址/数据和 PB7/NL，或 PD7/NCE2 的 NAND2。NE1/NCE2、NE2/NCE3 共享 chip-"
"select pad，配置拒绝相冲突的两个 personality。NAND3 需要 ZG 的 PG9。"
msgstr ""
"`fsmc-reference-*` routes describe silicon pad inventory; endpoint "
"parameters select the exact required subset. A Board must authorize the "
"route explicitly. Configuration does not substitute an unknown PCB or "
"discover installed devices. VE has no PF/PG pads, so the existing ZG "
"separate-address SRAM route cannot be reused. VE can explicitly select NE1 "
"with multiplexed address/data and PB7/NL, or NAND2 on PD7/NCE2. NE1/NCE2 and"
" NE2/NCE3 share chip-select pads; conflicting personalities are rejected. "
"NAND3 requires PG9 on ZG."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:40
msgid ""
"`tests/contracts/fsmc_assembly/` 是软件参考装配。它们没有指定真实存储器型号、PCB "
"或测得时序，也不代表实板资格。时序字段使用官方 LL 的编码周期约定；调用者依据 实际器件、电压、HCLK 和电气连接选择参数。器件自身的 PSRAM "
"burst/configuration 寄存器须与所选传输协议一致，不能由一份通用 pad 描述猜测。开启 NWAIT 可能使 CPU "
"总线访问由外部电平延长；有限 service 步数不构成错误电平下的硬件退出保证。"
msgstr ""
"`tests/contracts/fsmc_assembly/` contains software references without a real"
" memory part, PCB or measured timing, and establishes no hardware "
"qualification. Timing fields follow official LL encoded-cycle conventions. "
"The caller chooses parameters from the actual device, voltage, HCLK and "
"electrical connections. Device PSRAM burst/configuration registers must "
"agree with the selected protocol; generic pad facts cannot determine them. "
"NWAIT can extend CPU bus accesses according to an external level. Finite "
"service steps do not guarantee hardware exit under an incorrect level."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:46
msgid "NOR 的两种合同"
msgstr "Two NOR contracts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:48
msgid ""
"`nx_factory_flash_async()` 返回已有 NOR 端点；`nx_factory_flash_async_flash()` "
"使用同一个 `nx_flash_async_id_t` 返回同一状态的同步只读 Flash face。geometry/read 不保留目标； 同步 "
"program/erase 返回 `UNSUPPORTED`，不会发起一条返回时仍可能忙的 pulse。 已有同步 Flash 的“返回证明 pulse"
" idle”合同不变。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_factory_flash_async()` returns the existing NOR endpoint. "
"`nx_factory_flash_async_flash()` uses the same `nx_flash_async_id_t` to "
"return a synchronous readonly Flash face of the same state. Geometry/read "
"retains no destination. Synchronous program/erase returns `UNSUPPORTED` "
"rather than starting a pulse that may still be busy on return. The existing "
"synchronous Flash contract, where return proves the pulse idle, is "
"unchanged."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:53
msgid ""
"异步请求通过 `nx_flash_async_prepare/submit/cancel/service/stop` 使用有限 Core "
"deadline。 SUCCESS submit 只表示 ACCEPTED。一个 service 最多提交一个 word/byte program 或 "
"sector erase pulse；没有队列、worker、heap、HAL tick 或隐式重试。"
msgstr ""
"Asynchronous operations use "
"`nx_flash_async_prepare/submit/cancel/service/stop` with finite Core "
"deadlines. SUCCESS from submit means ACCEPTED only. One service call issues "
"at most one word/byte program or sector-erase pulse. There is no queue, "
"worker, heap, HAL tick or implicit retry."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:57
msgid ""
"命令集 1 是 Intel/Sharp，命令集 2 是 AMD/Fujitsu。unlock1、unlock2 与 CFI query 均为 "
"显式字节偏移；8 位与 16 位器件不能共用猜测的 word 地址。CFI 选择会检查 QRY、 主命令集、容量以及每一个 erase "
"region，并和完整声明 geometry 对照。关闭 CFI 表示调用者明确授权该命令集/几何，不能解释成探测成功。当前接口不提供 write-"
"buffer program、program/erase suspend 或芯片擦除等器件特定快捷命令。"
msgstr ""
"Command set1 is Intel/Sharp; set2 is AMD/Fujitsu. Unlock1, unlock2 and CFI-"
"query addresses are explicit byte offsets; 8- and 16-bit parts cannot share "
"assumed word addresses. Optional CFI checks QRY, the primary command set, "
"capacity and every erase region against the complete declared geometry. "
"Disabling CFI explicitly delegates command-set/geometry authorization to the"
" caller and does not mean successful discovery. Device-specific write-buffer"
" programming, program/erase suspend and chip erase are not exposed."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:63
msgid ""
"官方 HAL NOR 使用进程级全局 word width，program/erase 与 status 分离，等待路径依赖 "
"`HAL_GetTick`。这些行为不能同时保证多个不同宽度 bank 和 Core 借用排空。因此该 明确 SDK 缺口由 C11 "
"命令状态维护，继续复用同一个官方 LL 配置的物理 FSMC。"
msgstr ""
"Official HAL NOR uses a process-global word width, separates program/erase "
"from status, and waits through `HAL_GetTick`. That cannot simultaneously "
"preserve different-width banks and Core borrow/drain contracts. This "
"specific SDK gap is implemented by a C11 command state machine over the same"
" officially configured LL FSMC owner."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:67
msgid ""
"取消与 timeout 禁止后续 pulse；正在忙的 pulse 保留 request、program input 和 bank lease。 "
"DQ6/status ready 仍未证明 idle 时，状态保留为 DRAINING/QUARANTINED。错误或丢失 gate 不会释放借用。再次"
" service 只能观察和排空已有操作，不会重放命令。最早终止原因保持 不变；完成首次在 deadline 后观察到时报告 TIMEOUT。实际 "
"pulse idle 后先 detach，再 release-publication SETTLED。全 `0xff` program unit 不提交"
" pulse；erase provenance、 掉电恢复和产品分区由调用者负责。"
msgstr ""
"Cancellation and timeout prevent subsequent pulses. A busy pulse retains the"
" request, program input and bank lease. Until DQ6/status proves idle, the "
"request stays DRAINING/QUARANTINED. Errors or a lost gate never release "
"borrowing. Later service only observes/drains the operation and never "
"replays commands. The first terminal cause persists; completion first "
"observed after the deadline reports TIMEOUT. Actual pulse idle precedes "
"detach and release-publication of SETTLED. An all-`0xff` program unit does "
"not issue a pulse. Erase provenance, power-loss recovery and product "
"partitions belong to the caller."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:74
msgid "NAND 原始操作与 ECC"
msgstr "Raw NAND and ECC"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:76
msgid ""
"NAND 不映射成无坏块的普通 Flash。一个请求执行一页主数据及可选完整 OOB、仅 OOB、 "
"一个物理块擦除或显式复位。所有位置都是绝对物理页，包括坏块；库不扫描/跳过坏块， 不解释 OOB，不分配逻辑地址，不提供 FTL、文件系统或产品坏块表。"
msgstr ""
"NAND is not exposed as ordinary defect-free Flash. One request executes a "
"main page with optional complete OOB, OOB only, one physical-block erase or "
"explicit reset. Addresses are absolute physical pages, including bad blocks."
" The library does not scan/skip bad blocks, interpret OOB, allocate logical "
"addresses or provide an FTL, filesystem or product bad-block table."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:80
msgid ""
"几何统一以字节表达；16 位总线只改变列地址和每次数据总线单位。512 字节的小页与大页使用各自的地址/确认序列。ID "
"读取不推断或替换声明几何；`nx_nand_status` 返回 ready、failed 和 write_protected "
"的类型化快照，调用者无需解码器件状态位。状态查询不归还活动请求，写保护和器件失败仍向请求返回明确错误。"
msgstr ""
"Geometry is always in bytes. A 16-bit bus changes column addressing and each"
" bus access unit only. Small 512-byte pages and large pages use their own "
"address/confirm sequences. Reading ID never infers or replaces declared "
"geometry. `nx_nand_status` returns a typed ready, failed and write_protected"
" snapshot, so callers need not decode device status bits. A status query "
"does not release active requests; write protection and device failure still "
"produce explicit request errors."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:82
msgid ""
"`nx_nand_ecc_format` 在空闲已准备的同一 owner 上返回编码身份、step_bytes 和 code_bytes，不发出 "
"NAND 命令。当前身份 `NX_NAND_ECC_STM32_FSMC_RAW32` 表示每步一个数值 `uint32_t`；4 "
"字节是存储容器，不代表有效校验位数，也不是跨平台序列化格式或标准纠错算法。查询不推导纠错能力、OOB 放置或坏块策略，输出别名与忙状态在访问前拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"On the same idle prepared owner, `nx_nand_ecc_format` returns encoding "
"identity, step_bytes and code_bytes without issuing a NAND command. The "
"current identity `NX_NAND_ECC_STM32_FSMC_RAW32` means one numeric `uint32_t`"
" per step: four bytes describe the storage container, not the meaningful "
"parity-bit count, a portable serialized format or a standard correction "
"algorithm. The query infers no correction strength, OOB placement or bad-"
"block policy, and rejects output aliases and busy state before access."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:84
msgid ""
"ECC 是 FSMC 每 chunk 产生的原始代码：256..8192 字节的硬件 chunk 由配置选择， 可选输出数组每个主数据 chunk "
"对应一个 `uint32_t`。数据循环每次最多 32 个 bus unit， chunk 边界等待实际 FEMPT 后读取 ECCR，再 "
"disable 并回读 ECCEN；不调用带 tick 等待的 LL GetECC。部分 enable/disable "
"失败保留责任。代码的存放位置、校验纠错、OOB 格式和 可接受错误率完全由外部软件决定。"
msgstr ""
"ECC exposes raw hardware codes per chunk. Configuration selects hardware "
"chunks of 256..8192 bytes, with one optional `uint32_t` output per main-data"
" chunk. Data loops process at most 32 bus units per step. At chunk "
"boundaries, the provider waits for actual FEMPT, reads ECCR, disables ECC "
"and reads back ECCEN; it does not call tick-waiting LL GetECC. Partial "
"enable/disable failures retain responsibility. Code placement, correction, "
"OOB layout and acceptable error rate belong entirely to external software."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:90
msgid ""
"program data 尚在器件 latch 时取消会发出一次显式 reset，并继续等待 reset ready； confirm 已发出后的 "
"program/erase 不会被取消命令中断。页/OOB/ECC 借用直到设备与 ECC drain "
"都退出。错误读取可能已改写一部分目标，但只在完整成功时发布有效字节数； 错误的 transferred 为零。`ready_delay_us` "
"是实际器件忙状态建立时间的显式保守界， 避免在 tWB 等窗口内把旧 ready 状态误认作完成。"
msgstr ""
"Cancellation while program data remains in the device latch issues one "
"explicit reset and waits for reset-ready. Once confirm has been sent, "
"program/erase is not interrupted by cancellation. Page/OOB/ECC storage "
"remains borrowed until both device and ECC drain. Failed reads may have "
"modified a destination prefix, but valid bytes are published only after "
"complete success; error transferred counts are zero. `ready_delay_us` "
"explicitly declares a conservative device busy-assertion bound so an old "
"ready level during tWB is not mistaken for completion."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:96
msgid "生命周期与验证边界"
msgstr "Lifecycle and validation limits"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:98
msgid ""
"prepare 在首次写入前保存旧 bank control/read/write 寄存器，拒绝外来 NORSRAM、NAND、 PCCARD "
"或未拥有的 IRQ consumer。失败可保留 config/gate/bank receipt；调用者持续保存 全部来源并重试 "
"close/stop。没有备份 reset、SRAM 清零、自测、隐式芯片复位或 DMA 权限授予。每个 lease 的原始地址、generation "
"和精确 storage 身份保持到显式归还。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare snapshots original bank control/read/write registers before the "
"first write and rejects foreign NORSRAM, NAND, PCCARD or unowned IRQ "
"consumers. Failure may retain config/gate/bank receipts; all source storage "
"remains live for close/stop retries. There is no backup reset, SRAM "
"clearing, self-test, implicit chip reset or DMA authorization. Every lease "
"retains its original address, generation and exact storage identity until "
"explicit release."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:103
msgid ""
"顺序是：停止端点使用者，service 排空有限请求，close 端点 lease，stop shared bus， 最后由 Platform 恢复 "
"GPIO 快照。仍忙的端点或 boot receipt 使 bus stop 失败，不会关 gate 或恢复 pads。FSMC 外部存储器仍不授权 "
"STOP 中的 CPU/DMA 访问或可恢复执行域。"
msgstr ""
"The order is: stop endpoint users, service finite requests to drain, close "
"endpoint leases, stop the shared bus, then let Platform restore GPIO "
"snapshots. Busy endpoints or permanent boot receipts prevent bus stop "
"without withdrawing gates or pads. External FSMC memory does not authorize "
"CPU/DMA access during STOP or a resumable execution domain."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:107
msgid ""
"GoogleTest/Mock 执行真实 C owner、官方 LL 和命令状态，仅替换 MMIO 观察、CPU 边界与 "
"外部存储器端口。完整程序覆盖取消、late deadline、busy、gate/readback 失败、8/16 位、 CFI region 和 "
"ECC drain。ARM 消费者只证明精确 part 的选择、C11 编译、链接和资源预算； 物理 program/erase、WAIT 电气与 "
"retention 仍是 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest/Mock executes actual C owners, official LL and command state, "
"replacing only MMIO observations, CPU boundaries and external-memory ports. "
"Whole programs cover cancellation, late deadlines, busy hardware, "
"gate/readback refusal, 8/16-bit access, CFI regions and ECC drain. ARM "
"consumers establish exact-part selection, C11 compilation, linking and "
"resource budgets only. Physical program/erase, WAIT electrical behavior and "
"retention remain `not_executed`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:112
msgid "F479 SDRAM 的首个软件参考"
msgstr "Initial F479 SDRAM software reference"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:114
msgid ""
"`STM32F479NIH6` 的 FMC 增加独立 `sdram-controller` 模式，复用现有 `external_bus` 控制器和 "
"`memory_window-endpoint`：两种 face 指向同一 C owner， factory 只返回静态对象。本切片固定 Bank1、8"
" MiB、16 bit、12 行位／8 列位、 4 个内部 bank。默认 `cpu-window` 只授予 CPU 数据借用；额外的图形访问必须显式 "
"选择下述 `graphics-owned` 模式。两种模式都不授予 XIP、堆、启动对象或自动内存探测。 "
"具体器件时序必须由端点显式声明；软件参考数值不证明 RAM 实装或电气资格。"
msgstr ""
"The FMC on `STM32F479NIH6` adds an independent `sdram-controller` mode using"
" the existing `external_bus` controller and `memory_window-endpoint`. Both "
"faces refer to the same C owner; factory lookup returns static objects only."
" This slice fixes Bank1, 8 MiB, 16 bits, 12 row bits, 8 column bits and four"
" internal banks. The default `cpu-window` grants CPU data loans only; "
"additional graphics access requires explicitly selecting the `graphics-"
"owned` mode below. Neither mode grants XIP, a heap, startup objects or "
"automatic memory detection. Endpoints explicitly declare device timing; "
"software-reference values do not prove installed RAM or electrical "
"qualification."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:121
msgid ""
"参数保留七组 `nanoseconds`／`cycles` 最小值、CAS、SDCLK 分频、读管线、首次刷新 "
"次数、刷新窗口、上电等待和有限启停预算。配置工具拒绝几何不匹配、超过端点 `max_sdclk_hz`、不可编码的时序和非法刷新范围；C "
"在每次启动独立向上取整、满足 RC／WR 关系、计算 COUNT，并避开 RM0386 的禁止值。C 完成 CLK_ENABLE、实际完成后 "
"计时等待、PALL、AUTOREFRESH、LOAD_MODE 和刷新设置；读回不把 MODE／CTB 的只写位 当作成功证据。System 的原始 "
"`time_epoch` 必须持续有效，同频率／同 RCC 值不能 将旧 owner 接到新时间域。元数据预检在 System "
"之前只读执行，实际硬件行为全部在 C。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters retain seven minimum `nanoseconds`/`cycles` timing pairs, CAS, "
"SDCLK division, read pipeline, initial refresh count, refresh window, power-"
"up delay and finite start/stop budgets. Configuration rejects mismatched "
"geometry, endpoint `max_sdclk_hz` violations, unencodable timing and invalid"
" refresh ranges. At each startup, C rounds upward independently, satisfies "
"RC/WR relationships, computes COUNT and avoids prohibited RM0386 values. It "
"performs CLK_ENABLE, waits from actual completion, then PALL, AUTOREFRESH, "
"LOAD_MODE and refresh setup. Readback never treats write-only MODE/CTB "
"fields as success evidence. The original System `time_epoch` must remain "
"valid; identical frequencies or RCC values cannot adopt an old owner into a "
"new time domain. Metadata preflight is readonly and precedes System startup;"
" all actual hardware behavior remains in C."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:129
msgid ""
"两种窗口模式都要求 SYSCFG 时钟与 `SWP_FMC=0` 的实际可观察状态，驱动不修改全局 交换或 MPU。原始稳定 "
"lease、代次和派生指针使用者都退出后才能释放；停止以实际 Self-refresh／BUSY 状态证明写 FIFO 排空和 "
"tRAS，随后恢复自己取得的资源。 失去 lease、时间域或读回证据时保留清理责任，不撤销已有 CPU 指针。同一持久 owner 可以恢复自己的 "
"Self-refresh，并从实际 NORMAL 完成之后等待完整 tXSR／上电间隔。"
msgstr ""
"Both window modes require the SYSCFG clock and an actually observable "
"`SWP_FMC=0`; the driver changes neither global swapping nor MPU "
"configuration. Every original stable lease, generation and derived-pointer "
"user must exit before release. Stop uses actual Self-refresh/BUSY state to "
"prove write-FIFO drain and tRAS, then restores resources acquired by this "
"owner. Lost lease, time-domain or readback proof retains cleanup "
"responsibility and never revokes existing CPU pointers. The same persistent "
"owner can restore its own Self-refresh and wait the full tXSR/power-up "
"interval after actual NORMAL completion."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:135
msgid ""
"ES0321 §2.3.4 要求保持共享 `FMC_BCR1.WFDIS=0`。FMC gate 关闭时不能可靠读取 "
"该位：静态预检不假装完成物理证明，prepare 取得 gate 后在引脚／首条命令前检查， 后续命令与新借用再次检查。驱动不自动修改外来 "
"WFDIS；已初始化后约束失效会阻止 新借用和普通停止并保留 owner／gate。只有尚未发命令／借用的 phase0 冷拒绝， 能够保持原 BCR1"
" 不变并归还自己取得的 gate。实现见 [SDRAM 私有合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/memory/stm32f4_sdram.h)。"
msgstr ""
"ES0321 §2.3.4 requires shared `FMC_BCR1.WFDIS=0`. This bit cannot be read "
"reliably with the FMC gate off. Static preflight does not pretend to supply "
"physical proof. After acquiring the gate, prepare checks it before pads or "
"the first command; later commands and new borrows recheck it. The driver "
"never silently changes foreign WFDIS. Losing this constraint after "
"initialization blocks new borrows and ordinary stop, retaining the "
"owner/gate. Only a phase 0 cold rejection before any command or borrow can "
"leave the original BCR1 unchanged and return the gate it acquired. See the "
"[private SDRAM contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/memory/stm32f4_sdram.h)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:142
msgid "显式图形存储模式"
msgstr "Explicit graphics-owned storage"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:144
msgid ""
"将 SDRAM 端点的 `mode` 设为 `graphics-owned`，并在所选 `display`／`image` 控制器中用 "
"`memory_window` 引用该端点 ID，才会建立图形连接。配置拒绝 CPU-only 端点、未知引用和没有图形使用者的 `graphics-"
"owned` 窗口。完整软件参考见 "
"[`stm32f4_graphics_sdram/combined.toml`](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_graphics_sdram/combined.toml)。 RM0386 Rev6 "
"§2.1.8–9 说明 LTDC／DMA2D 到 FMC 的总线路径，§12.8 规定 SDRAM 控制器行为；芯片总线可达性本身不构成 Nexus "
"的权限或生命周期授权。"
msgstr ""
"Set the SDRAM endpoint's `mode` to `graphics-owned` and reference its "
"endpoint ID through `memory_window` in each selected `display`/`image` "
"controller to establish a graphics connection. Configuration rejects CPU-"
"only endpoints, unknown references and `graphics-owned` windows without a "
"graphics consumer. See the complete software reference in "
"[`stm32f4_graphics_sdram/combined.toml`](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_graphics_sdram/combined.toml). RM0386 Rev6 "
"sections2.1.8–9 describe the LTDC/DMA2D bus routes to FMC; section12.8 "
"defines the SDRAM controller. Silicon bus reachability alone establishes no "
"Nexus permission or lifecycle authorization."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:151
msgid ""
"生成器为该 bank 建立一个静态私有连接，将原始稳定 window lease 与两个精确 controller 身份关联。每个图形控制器在冷态 "
"prepare 时附着，首个附着取得 lease， 最后一个成功冷态 close 才归还。生成的区域只向具名 LTDC 授予读取，向具名 DMA2D "
"授予读写；其他控制器和芯片全局 DMA 事实不变。图形请求继续检查完整容量、对齐、 格式、步长和别名，且核对原 System／时间代次、bank "
"状态和选定映射。"
msgstr ""
"The generator creates one static private binding for the bank, associating "
"its original stable window lease with two exact controller identities. Each "
"graphics controller attaches during cold prepare; the first attachment "
"acquires the lease, and only the last successful cold close releases it. "
"Generated regions grant reads only to the named LTDC and reads/writes to the"
" named DMA2D. Other controllers and global silicon DMA facts remain "
"unchanged. Graphics requests still validate complete capacities, alignment, "
"formats, strides and aliases, and check the original System/time epoch, bank"
" state and selected mapping."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:157
msgid ""
"Platform 先启动 SDRAM，再准备图形控制器；冷停止按反序先退出图形硬件、IRQ 和 保留引用，再尝试停止 bank。请求达到 SETTLED"
" 不代表控制器完成冷态 close。公共 `display.stop`／`image.stop` 只有在所选 provider 完成硬件／IRQ "
"冷退出并返回 SUCCESS 后才解除附着；BUSY 或错误继续保留 bank 责任。仍附着的控制器使 bank 停止及 Self-refresh "
"被拒绝；部分失败保留原连接和 lease，重试必须完成真实冷退出。"
msgstr ""
"Platform starts SDRAM before preparing the graphics controllers. Cold stop "
"withdraws graphics hardware, IRQs and retained references in reverse order "
"before attempting to stop the bank. Request SETTLED does not establish "
"controller cold close. Public `display.stop`/`image.stop` detaches only "
"after the selected provider completes hardware/IRQ cold withdrawal and "
"returns SUCCESS; BUSY or an error retains bank responsibility. An attached "
"controller blocks bank stop and Self-refresh. Partial failure retains the "
"original binding and lease; retry must complete the actual cold withdrawal."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md:163
msgid ""
"该模式保留 geometry 查询，但公共 CPU window acquire／release 不可用，不能借其 factory face "
"取得或提前归还私有图形 lease。这是配合式 provider 准入合同，不是 MPU 或 BusMatrix 防火墙，不能物理阻止任意原始 CPU "
"指针。参考装配没有实装 SDRAM 型号、PCB 或面板；带宽与物理验证边界见 [图形 provider "
"合同](../stm32-provider.md#f479-ltdc-scanout-and-dma2d-memory-operations)。"
msgstr ""
"The mode retains geometry queries, but public CPU window acquire/release is "
"unavailable. Its factory face cannot acquire or prematurely release the "
"private graphics lease. This is a cooperative provider admission contract, "
"not an MPU or BusMatrix firewall; it cannot physically block arbitrary raw "
"CPU pointers. The reference establishes no fitted SDRAM part, PCB or panel. "
"See the [graphics provider contract](../stm32-provider.md#f479-ltdc-scanout-"
"and-dma2d-memory-operations) for bandwidth and physical-validation "
"boundaries."
